<http://data.silknow.org/object/6e8167bb-b06b-3376-95d5-f2cfb13790cb>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "John Lea Nevinson, Catalogue of English Domestic Embroidery of the Sixteenth & Seventeenth Centuries, Victoria and Albert Museum, Department of Textiles, London: HMSO, 1938, p.7\nAnthony Wells-Cole, Art and Decoration in Elizabethan England : The Influence of Continental Prints 1558-1625 (Yale University Press, 1997), p.244"@en ;
